## Forensic evidence: Priya's timer_init() and main loop, replayed on the model
## She wants the LED to toggle once per second.
write RCC_APB1ENR = 1
write TIM2_PSC = 7199
write TIM2_ARR = 9999
write TIM2_CR1 = 1
blink: wait for UIF, write 0 to TIM2_SR, toggle LED
  LED toggle 1 at t = 0.139 ms (0.139 ms after the previous)
  LED toggle 2 at t = 0.139 ms (0.000 ms after the previous)
  LED toggle 3 at t = 0.139 ms (0.000 ms after the previous)
  LED toggle 4 at t = 0.139 ms (0.000 ms after the previous)
read  TIM2_SR -> 0x1
